# M10/008 — R-203 batch 1: reviewed deletion mechanism (D-152) + list DEL-001
# date: 2026-11-12; base origin/main=0b1b1875dee2f5623ee6c5475e69ee3575db0720 (PR #360 merge)

## 1. Design
- scripts/check_no_delete.py: deletions pass only for paths in docs/governance/deletions/DEL-NNN.list
  present at the merge base (git show <merge-base>:...), whose D-NNN section in DECISIONS.md cites the file.
- lists immutable once merged; a PR that deletes may not add/modify a list; new lists validated against HEAD
  (format, decision, every path tracked); no labels / PR text / environment override.
- no lists => zero tolerance exactly as before (R-152 tests unchanged).

